<section class="network-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="network-header"><span class="label">One property-first system</span><h2>Useful for the buyer. <em>Practical for the Realtor.</em></h2><p>Turn a property into an educational report, a permissioned buyer signal, reusable marketing support, and a more organized path for follow-up.</p></div>
    <div class="network-grid">
      <article class="network-card"><div class="icon">▣</div><h3>Property report delivery</h3><p>Create an educational property-financing report from an MLS number and share a clearer next step with a buyer.</p></article>
      <article class="network-card"><div class="icon">↗</div><h3>Direct buyer and lead follow-up</h3><p>Add the appropriate buyer, open a prepared email, or reuse a generic report link through your approved email or CRM workflow.</p></article>
      <article class="network-card"><div class="icon">♙</div><h3>Buyer engagement workspace</h3><p>Track property campaigns, report activity, buyer milestones, and high-level Funders updates from one workspace.</p></article>
      <article class="network-card"><div class="icon">✦</div><h3>Branded marketing support</h3><p>Use your saved profile to support social graphics, a property brochure, and editable follow-up messages.</p></article>
      <article class="network-card"><div class="icon">⇄</div><h3>Compare homes</h3><p>Use the same illustrative financing assumptions to compare homes with a buyer who is narrowing a shortlist.</p></article>
      <article class="network-card"><div class="icon">⌁</div><h3>Optional Open House QR campaigns</h3><p>Add QR registration, campaign timing, and live engagement tracking when an Open House is part of the plan.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="network-section soft" id="network-how-it-works">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="network-header"><span class="label">The shared workflow</span><h2>From a property to a <em>clearer next step.</em></h2><p>The Realtor stays central to the property conversation. The Funders Team handles the confidential financing workflow when the buyer is ready.</p></div>
    <div class="workflow">
      <article class="workflow-step"><b>1</b><h3>Create from the property</h3><p>Enter the MLS number, review the property details, and create the report or campaign.</p></article>
      <article class="workflow-step"><b>2</b><h3>Connect the buyer</h3><p>Add an existing buyer or lead, or use an optional QR campaign to capture permissioned interest.</p></article>
      <article class="workflow-step"><b>3</b><h3>Share and follow</h3><p>Send the report through your approved workflow and act on useful engagement milestones.</p></article>
      <article class="workflow-step"><b>4</b><h3>Keep moving</h3><p>Continue the property relationship while The Funders Team supports private financing next steps.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

